OL,3,GNEWSAPassports needed for ferry
OL,4,Apassengers travelling between UK and
OL,5,AIreland
OL,6,
OL,7,FPassengers travelling on ferries
OL,8,Fbetween the UK and the Republic of
OL,9,FIreland will need to show their
OL,10,Fpassport from Monday.
OL,12,FFerry operator Irish Ferries said the
OL,13,Fnew requirement applies to their Dublin
OL,14,Fto Holyhead and Rosslare to Pembroke
OL,15,Froutes, in both directions.
OL,17,FStena Line said all passengers
OL,18,Ftravelling from Dublin, Holyhead,
OL,19,FFishguard or Rosslare ports would also
OL,20,Fbe required to present a valid passport
OL,21,Fat check-in.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
